    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>This medallion hangs on a leather cord, a silver disc inscribed with the Sihedron.</p>\n<p>While worn, a Sihedron medallion grants the wearer a +1 item bonus to saving throws.</p>\n<p>Placed on the neck of a dead body, a Sihedron medallion preserves the body indefinitely as a 2nd level @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.xRgU9rrhmGAgG4Rc]{Gentle Repose} spell as long as the medallion is on the body.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate </strong><span class=\"pf2-icon\">A</span> command; <strong>Frequency</strong> once per day; <strong>Effect </strong>the amulet casts a 2nd level @Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.8ViwItUgwT4lOvvb]{False Life} on the wearer.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e-conversion-rotrl.rotrl-items.HJ1oO5CyI6XyR8YU]{Spell Effect: False Life}</p>",
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": ""
